From ef7486f604701608a2571d7b6e20815938592036 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ninthcj <327845320+ninthcj@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:16:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] recovery: confirm install of unverified package on
 explicitly unlocked devices

Offer a No/Yes prompt (Signature verification failed / Install untrusted
package?) only for interactive installs when ro.boot.flash.locked is 0 and
the text UI is visible. Unattended, update_package, rescue and
sideload-auto-reboot installs, and wipe packages, stay strict.
